cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "IPRAL-Lidar-Processing: calibration and backscatter retrieval for IPRAL 355 nm far-range signals"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Are-had/IPRAL-Lidar-Processing"
abstract: >-
  Research processing chain for the IPRAL 355 nm far-range lidar (SIRTA):
  L0 to L1 calibration (calibration coefficient, residual background,
  polarization cross-talk, analog/photon-counting merging) and L1 to L2
  particle backscatter retrieval (Klett-Fernald-Sasano inversion).
  Developed to support the ATLID/EarthCARE zenith-to-nadir comparison.
  this is not the official IPRAL/SIRTA processing.
keywords:
  - lidar
  - IPRAL
  - SIRTA
  - calibration
  - Klett inversion
  - ATLID
  - EarthCARE
authors:
